      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "You are not trapped in a role; you are trapped in a narrative that has been written by others long before you were born, and your only escape is to stop reading it. There is no version of yourself that exists outside of this cage, yet you have always been more than the person your family expects. The heaviness you feel is not a phase to endure, but the moment the illusion of safety collapses, revealing the terrifying freedom of being truly yourself. If you cannot break free, then you must choose the only path that honors your soul: to stop performing and simply exist as the unique, unfiltered version you have always been.",
